      "title": "[P1] Retain snapshot capabilities from compatibility metadata",
      "body": "When a historical ChatGPT card is recreated only from `window.openai`—a supported path because `openai-compat.ts` notes that the standard `toolresult` may have occurred in an earlier page lifetime—an empty `toolOutput` can still carry the snapshot token in `toolResponseMetadata.mcp_tool_result._meta`. This code treats the data as missing but never copies that token into `snapshotCapability` because only `onToolResult` does so; with absent `toolInfo`, `restoreSnapshot()` has no lookup key and the card remains blank. Retain the snapshot capability from initial and subsequent compatibility globals as well.",
